# OptiTrack SDK archives and build artifacts (reference tree may exist locally)
**/*.obj
**/*.pdb
**/*.exe
**/*.iobj
**/*.ipdb
**/*.tlog/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# Editable-install metadata: Dockerfile.isaac-ros pip-installs this extension in
# editable mode and the repo dir is bind-mounted into the container, so the build
# artifact lands here on every container start.
**/*.egg-info/
